    "created_at": "2017-03-09T17:57:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-09T17:57:14Z",
    "body": "I did not ask to expose network error details, that was anne's suggestion above. I'm asking to expose a human-readable helpful message as to what might be wrong. Giving an error \"network error\" versus \"out of memory\" already is more helpful (\"do I go and buy more RAM?\" or \"should I call my ISP?\" or \"internal error, file a bug?\") compared to having to play a guessing game. I don't think there is anything that relates to security here?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
